ock-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/Russells-American-Mechanical-group-photo-of-all-employees.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"Russell&#039;s American Mechanical group photo of all employees in Chesapeake\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/Russells-American-Mechanical-group-photo-of-all-employees.jpg 2000w, /images/2024/06/Russells-American-Mechanical-group-photo-of-all-employees-300x192.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/Russells-American-Mechanical-group-photo-of-all-employees-1024x655.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/Russells-American-Mechanical-group-photo-of-all-employees-768x492.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/Russells-American-Mechanical-group-photo-of-all-employees-1536x983.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" title=\"Russell&#039;s American Mechanical group photo of all employees in Chesapeake - Russell’s American Mechanical\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-primary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow pb-4 has-primary-inverse-color has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-4\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left mt-0 h-decorator--white h-decorator-md h-decorator\">Who we are</h2>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group wrap-mobile flow pb-4 is-horizontal is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a2f35af1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>A One-Stop Shop for All Your Home Service Needs</strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tired of juggling multiple vendors for different home services? At Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, we’ve got you covered. Whether it’s your HVAC system, plumbing, or electrical work, our team of experts is equipped to handle it all, saving you time, hassle, and stress.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Expertise Backed by Training</strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our dedicated training staff ensures every technician is equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to provide top-notch service. We don’t just meet industry standards—we exceed them, delivering results that keep your home running smoothly.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Worry-Free Program</strong></h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enjoy peace of mind with our Worry-Free Program, designed to make home maintenance easy and predictable. From routine maintenance to unexpected repairs, we’ve created a service experience that takes the guesswork out of home care.</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What We Do</strong>&nbsp;</h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/services/heating-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Heating</a> work runs from furnaces to heat pumps to boilers. <a href=\"/services/cooling-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Cooling</a> covers central air, mini-splits, and zoning. Licensed electricians handle <a href=\"/services/electrical-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">electrical service</a> from outlets to full panel work, and the <a href=\"/services/generators-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">generator team</a> installs and services standby power. <a href=\"/services/plumbing-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Plumbing</a> and <a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-chesapeake-va\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">indoor air quality</a> round out the trades, all dispatched from the same operation.&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"our-promise container should-overlap \" >\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"483\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-bumping-a-customers-fist-1024x773.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician consulting a residential HVAC customer in Chesapeake, VA\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-bumping-a-customers-fist-1024x773.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-bumping-a-customers-fist-300x226.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-bumping-a-customers-fist-768x580.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-bumping-a-customers-fist-1536x1159.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-bumping-a-customers-fist.jpg 1696w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" title=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician consulting a residential HVAC customer in Chesapeake, VA - Russell’s American Mechanical\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Experts in HVAC, Plumbing, Electrical, and Generators in Chesapeake, VA and Surrounding Areas</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical is your trusted expert in HVAC, plumbing, electrical, and generator services in Chesapeake, VA, and the surrounding Hampton Roads area. Our skilled technicians provide comprehensive solutions, including heating and cooling system installations, plumbing repairs, electrical upgrades, and generator services to ensure your home runs efficiently year-round. Whether you need routine maintenance or emergency repairs, we deliver reliable, high-quality service tailored to your specific needs. Serving Chesapeake, Norfolk, Virginia Beach, and beyond, Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical is committed to keeping your home comfortable, safe, and fully operational. Contact us today for expert HVAC, plumbing, electrical, and generator services you can count on.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Certifications and Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 3;\" data-logo-count=\"3\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--start\" aria-label=\"See previous\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:3;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"157\" src=\"/images/2024/06/2020-Best-of-Chesapeake-and-2020-Best-of-Virginia-Beach-Golder-Winner-badges-1-300x157.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"2020 Best of Chesapeake and 2020 Best of Virginia Beach Golder Winner badges\" sizes=\"(max-width: 680px) 150px, (max-width: 820px) 128px, (max-width: 1024px) 100px, 128px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/2020-Best-of-Chesapeake-and-2020-Best-of-Virginia-Beach-Golder-Winner-badges-1-300x157.png 300w, /images/2024/06/2020-Best-of-Chesapeake-and-2020-Best-of-Virginia-Beach-Golder-Winne