or has-secondary-inverse-color splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center align-center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow my-auto mt-auto mb-auto is-vertical is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f9faaab3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 h1 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-6\">Proudly Serving the Communities In &amp; Around Hampton Roads for Over 45 Years</h2>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile w100 elevated-3-2 max-h-350 box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignleft size-full w100\"><img title=\"Vintage photo of an HVAC technician in a Russells service truck in Chesapeake, Virginia - Russell’s American Mechanical\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"982\" height=\"784\" src=\"/images/2024/07/Vintage-photo-of-a-technician-in-a-Russells-service-truck.jpg\" alt=\"Vintage photo of a technician in a Russells service truck\" class=\"wp-image-6085\" srcset=\"/images/2024/07/Vintage-photo-of-a-technician-in-a-Russells-service-truck.jpg 982w, /images/2024/07/Vintage-photo-of-a-technician-in-a-Russells-service-truck-300x240.jpg 300w, /images/2024/07/Vintage-photo-of-a-technician-in-a-Russells-service-truck-768x613.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 982px) 100vw, 982px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"careers\" class=\"container splitter mobile-flip-splitter splitter--uniform-height-stick-last\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--start wp-elements-7 has-background has-primary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow w100 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3 h2 has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-8\">Careers at Our Company</h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">Russell’s American Mechanical is setting up a new standard for home services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our technicians with resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. Come join us; we protect the people and culture that make our branch great while ensuring our customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://jobs.dayforcehcm.com/en-US/nearu/Russells\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta my-3\">\n    <span >Open Positions</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border full-height-image mobile-3-2-ratio\"><img title=\"Best Place to Work Trophy for Russell&#039;s American Mechanical in Chesapeake, Virginia - Russell’s American Mechanical\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1916\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical.jpg\" alt=\"A “Best Places to Work” trophy for Russell’s American Mechanical\" class=\"wp-image-5774\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical.jpg 1916w, /images/2024/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-Best-Places-to-Work-trophy-for-Russells-American-Mechanical-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1916px) 100vw, 1916px\" /></figure>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-primary-inverse-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center py-4 has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-10\"><strong>Keeping Hampton Roads &amp; Surrounding Areas Comfortable Since 1977</strong></h2>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Our Commitment to You</strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, we’re not just here to fix problems—we’re here to build lasting relationships with our community.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Dedicated to Chesapeake:</strong> We’re proud to be an involved part of our community, supporting local initiatives and giving back where it matters most.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Proactive Communication:</strong> We believe in keeping things simple. With clear, consistent updates, you won’t have to follow up with us—we’ll keep you informed every step of the way.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Simplify Your Home Care with Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical</strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When you need reliable, expert home services, Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical is here to deliver. Call us today to schedule your appointment and experience the convenience of working with a single, trusted provider for all your home maintenance needs.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Let us take the stress out of home care with expert service, clear communication, and a dedication to your peace of mind.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n(function(){\n             var d = document, t = 'script',\n                 o = d.createElement(t),\n                 s = d.getElementsByTagName(t)[0];\n                 o.src = 'https://app.realworklabs.com/static/plugin/loader.js?v=' + new Date().getTime();\n                 window.addEventListener('rwlPluginReady', function () {\n                     window.rwlPlugin.init('https://app.realworklabs.com', 'zhfV6bItpbSiCSIx');\n                }, false);\n                s.parentNode.insertBefore(o, s);\n\n            }());\n</script>\n<div class=\"content-fullbleed\">\n<div id=\"rwl-map\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container flow py-5\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Powered by NearU — We’re here to make your experience the best one yet!</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img title=\"NearU logo - Russell’s American Mechanical\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"430\" height=\"98\" src=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png\" alt=\"NearU\" class=\"wp-image-36\" style=\"width:220px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/NearU.png 430w, /images/2024/02/NearU-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" /></figure>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">NearU is setting up a new standard of HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator services with major improvements to reliability, convenience, and customer care. We equip our companies with better resources, training, and tools, so they can provide you with the best possible service outcome. If you’ve recently learned that your go-to HVAC, plumbing, drains, IAQ, and generator company has joined NearU, then this is something to get excited about! We protect the people and culture that make each company great, while ensuring their customers consistently receive the best possible care.</p>\n</div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-65 -->"
